The first Dartmouth [INAUDIBLE].

10
00:00:23,573 --> 00:00:24,680
That's right.

11
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:25,642
And then--

12
00:00:25,642 --> 00:00:27,350
What is the association
to Stanford here?

13
00:00:27,350 --> 00:00:30,480

14
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:33,010
I believe this is [INAUDIBLE].

